Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.29,0:00:02.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Previously on Grey's Anatomy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.29,0:00:02.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}前情提要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We had sex. Once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们只是上过一次床
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:04.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和我约会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know you're my boss.
