Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:07.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也知道这违反规定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:09.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you like Izzie? Is that what this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:09.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你喜欢伊兹吗？是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.25,0:00:11.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Izzie? No. She's not the one I'm attracted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.25,0:00:11.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊兹？不是 我喜欢的人不是她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not the one. So there's a one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是她 那就另有其人了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:15.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Haven't you ever been attracted to someone you know you couldn't have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:15.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道你从没喜欢过一个 明知追不到的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:18.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:18.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是咖啡而已
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:19.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- OK. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:21.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好吧 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:23.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But your mother's Alzheimer's is advancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:23.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你母亲的阿尔茨海默症越来越严重
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:25.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So while she's still lucid enough to consent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:25.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}趁她还算神智清楚时 必须同意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:27.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}she needs to sign everything over to you.
