Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:30.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for the coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:30.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你的咖啡
