Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:38.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}酒醒之后就更无趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.12,0:00:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mind moving this tail wagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.12,0:00:42.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}麻烦移一下车
