Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:43.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的车出不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.54,0:00:48.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A couple hundred years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.54,0:00:48.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两百多年前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:52.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Benjamin Franklin shared with the world the secret of his success...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:52.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}班杰明富兰克林 曾向世人分享他的成功秘诀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:57.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Never leave that till tomorrow," he said, "what you can do today."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:57.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说：“今日事 今日毕”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:06.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is the man who discovered electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:06.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}富兰克林发现了电
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.67,0:01:09.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd think more of us would listen to what he had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.67,0:01:09.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还以为大多数人会听从他的忠告
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.71,0:01:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know why we put things off,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.71,0:01:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道大家为何总是惯性拖延
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:18.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but if I had to guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:18.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过若要我猜的话
