Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.71,0:01:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想主要应该是因为害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:25.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fear of failure,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:25.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}害怕失败
