Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}害怕痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.79,0:01:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}fear of rejection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.79,0:01:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}害怕遭拒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:36.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wouldn't it be easier to just ask her out?
