Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:04:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若被发现 他们会开除我吗？还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:01.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:02.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not officially.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:02.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}表面上不会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:07.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll just get edged out, blacklisted,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:07.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你只会被排挤、列入黑名单
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}banned from his surgeries,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}禁止参与他的手术
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:11.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}passed over for chief resident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:11.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当不了总住院医师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:14.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It'll be humiliating, but you'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:14.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然很丢脸 但是死不了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:16.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:16.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我必须结束这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:18.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I definitely have to end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:18.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我非结束不可
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:21.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to end it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:21.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我必须结束 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:23.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:23.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.67,0:04:24.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.67,0:04:24.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:28.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you seriously just tell me to shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:28.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你刚才是叫我闭嘴吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:29.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:29.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:32.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got a hot doctor who likes to make you open up and say "ahh."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:32.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你找到一个性感医生 还鼓励你敞开心扉…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:34.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the American dream. Stop whining about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:34.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简直就是美国梦 别再抱怨了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:37.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No good can come from sleeping with your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:37.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 和上司上床绝对不会有好结果
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:38.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cristina, you're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:38.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里斯廷娜 你迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:39.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So is Meredith.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:39.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝也是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whatever it is we're afraid of, one thing holds true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无论我们害怕什么 唯有一件事不会改变
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If, by the time the pain of not doing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就是逃避某件事的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:47.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}a thing gets worse than the fear of doing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:47.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}变得比去做这件事的恐惧更糟糕时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}it can feel like we're carrying around a giant tumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那种感觉就像是长了个巨大的肿瘤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:53.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When we walk in this door, you will maintain decorum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:53.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}进了这扇门 你们要举止得体
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:56.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You will not laugh, vomit, or drop your jaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:56.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不准笑、呕吐、震惊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:57.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are we understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:04:57.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:04:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would we laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:04:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么会笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:00.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:00.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.29,0:05:01.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good morning, Miss Connors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.29,0:05:01.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早上好 康纳斯女士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:03.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:03.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.96,0:05:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.96,0:05:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:09.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:09.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肿瘤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:12.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you thought I was speaking metaphorically.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:12.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你刚才还以为我是在打比方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:37.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}实习医生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:45.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good morning, Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:45.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早上好 安妮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:48.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How are you? This is Dr. Bailey, and these are my fellow interns.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:48.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你感觉如何？这位是贝利医生 这几位也是实习医生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.79,0:05:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Karev, we refer to patients as "mister".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.79,0:05:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡瑞医生 对患者不可直呼其名
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I told him to call me "Annie."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我要他叫我安妮的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:55.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Ms. Connors" makes me feel old and fat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:55.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“康纳斯女士”听上去又老又肥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:58.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}which I am, but why feel that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:58.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然我确实如此 但何必让自己难受呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:02.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Annie, this is Dr. Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:02.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}安妮 这位是柏克医生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:04.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Awesome surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:04.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一流外科医生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Karev.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡瑞医生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:11.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh! Annie Connors is a 43-year-old woman who presented last night
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:11.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}安妮康纳斯今年43岁 昨晚入院
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:14.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}with progressive shortness of breath for the past three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:14.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她过去三个月来出现渐进性呼吸短促
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:17.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Found to have a very large tumor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:17.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}目前已发现一颗成因不明的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:20.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}of unknown origin pressed against her diaphragm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:20.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}巨大肿瘤正在压迫她的横膈膜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stable vital signs. Scheduled for CT this morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}生命征象稳定 今早安排她做电脑断层扫描
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:24.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you, Dr. Karev.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:24.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 卡瑞医生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you at all claustrophobic?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是否有幽闭恐惧症？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:28.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been housebound for the last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:28.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过去一年我都待在家里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How claustrophobic could I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是能有什么幽闭恐惧症？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:34.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Stevens is going to take you up for a CT.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:34.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史蒂文斯医生 会带你去照电脑断层扫描
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It'll give us a better look at the tumor, and we'll know how to proceed from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样我们会更了解肿瘤的状况 就知道接下来该如何治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:39.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could someone tell my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:39.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人可以通知我妈吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:42.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She'll worry if she gets back and I'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:42.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她回来发现我不在会担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.58,0:06:43.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, of course. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.58,0:06:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:47.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And would it be possible for Alex to take me instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:47.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以让亚力克带我去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:51.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, he's, he's just so fun to look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:51.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毕竟光看着他也开心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:54.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:54.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}安妮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:55.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:55.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure, Ms. Connors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 康纳斯女士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.17,0:06:58.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.17,0:06:58.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}失陪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.46,0:07:03.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How much do you think it weighs? - 60 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.46,0:07:03.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你觉得那有多重？ - 27公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}More. She's carrying around a whole extra person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}更重 她简直多了一个人的重量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:07.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This one's going in the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:07.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这绝对会变成教材案例
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.33,0:07:09.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I've got to get in. - I almost did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.33,0:07:09.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我必须要参加 - 我差点成了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:12.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you ever seen Alex like that? He actually seemed sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:12.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们见过亚力克那模样吗？ 他看上去超级真诚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:13.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Seemed" being the operative word.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:13.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“看上去”是关键
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.88,0:07:15.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was on call when she came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.88,0:07:15.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她入院时正好是他值班
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.75,0:07:17.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am never leaving this place again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.75,0:07:17.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再也不离开医院了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:19.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's move, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:19.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家动作快
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:22.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ms. Connor's surgery, should we choose to proceed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:22.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我们决定帮康纳斯女士动手术
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}will take most, if not all, of the surgeons off the floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将会几乎需要这一层的所有医生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.12,0:07:28.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}which means you people will have to work extra hard not to kill anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.12,0:07:28.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这也代表你们必须更加小心 别害死患者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:31.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}'cause we won't be there to fix your mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:31.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为没人有空帮你们善后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.25,0:07:32.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.25,0:07:32.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柏克医生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:37.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really want in on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:37.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的很想参加这次手术
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:39.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought we weren't talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:39.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不是不交谈吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:41.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not talking. I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:41.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没和你谈 只是说出看法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:46.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Find her mother, get a family history, and I'll tell Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:46.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去找她母亲 查查家族病史 我会和贝利说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.79,0:07:52.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Harper had a coronary bypass yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.79,0:07:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哈波先生昨天做了冠状动脉绕道手术
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:54.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His blood pressure, currently 100/65.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:54.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}目前血压100/65
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.71,0:07:59.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was running low overnight down to 70/30, but responded to medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.71,0:07:59.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}昨晚降到了70/30 但药物治疗有起色
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:02.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Postoperative labs show a crit of 30 and normal coagulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:02.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}术后化验数据 血球容积比30% 凝血正常
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:05.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chest-tube output has halted over the last two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:05.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}胸管引流已停止两小时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:06.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:06.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接下来有何打算？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:09.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chest x-ray and check the tube for possible occlusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:09.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}照胸片 检查胸管是否有闭塞情形
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:10.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:11.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好 他的状况良好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:11.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:14.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:14.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:26.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you think I like Meredith, but I don't like Meredith.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:26.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你以为我喜欢梅若迪丝 但我没有喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:27.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:27.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.21,0:08:29.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I like Meredith. Obviously, I like Meredith.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.21,0:08:29.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我喜欢梅若迪丝 我当然喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:32.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just don't have a thing for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:32.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是对她没有那种意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:33.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:33.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:36.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just this morning, I know you were probably just teasing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:36.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道今天早上你可能只是在逗我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.21,0:08:39.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but I don't want you to say anything like that to her, because we live together,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.21,0:08:39.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我不希望你对她开那种玩笑 因为我们住在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.17,0:08:40.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and that would be really awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.17,0:08:40.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那样会变得很尴尬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:42.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- George, stop talking. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:42.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 乔治 别再说了 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:49.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.62,0:08:54.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Levangie, this is Dr. Bailey and her fine staff of surgical interns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.62,0:08:54.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}勒凡吉先生 这位是贝利医生 以及她底下优秀的实习医生们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:01.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Welcome to hell, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:01.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欢迎来到地狱 孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's presenting?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁来陈述病情？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:08.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Edward Levangie is a 63-year-old man
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:08.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爱德华勒凡吉 63岁男性
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:10.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}admitted for pain management for dyskinesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:10.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因异动症入院接受控制疼痛治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:12.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's been stable since last night
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:12.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}昨晚开始他的病情就很稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:14.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and responding well to the bolus injections.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:14.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}全剂量注射药物后反应良好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.67,0:09:16.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Izzie, possible treatments?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.67,0:09:16.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伊兹 说说可行疗法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For Parkinson's disease? Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}治疗帕金森氏症吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Deep brain stimulation has shown very... - Not for Parkinson's, for spinal pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 脑深层刺激术很有… - 不是帕金森氏症 是脊椎疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:24.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:30.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Intraspinal catheter. That way, he can have constant pain medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:30.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}脊椎内导管 这样能以药物持续治疗疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:31.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:31.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.79,0:09:32.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is Dr. Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.79,0:09:32.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这位是葛蕾医生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:35.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's gonna prep you for the procedure and assist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:35.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她会帮你做术前准备并且从旁协助
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:40.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:40.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}失陪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:48.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You make yourselves busy. I'll catch up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:48.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们先去忙吧 我等等就来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Miranda.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}米兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.67,0:10:08.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that's your name, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.67,0:10:08.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是你的名字吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:09.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's on your jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绣在你的医生袍上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:11.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, fine, I'll just call you "Bailey" then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:11.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算了 我还是叫你贝利就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think you're charming and that talented,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你顶着那一头神经兮兮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:16.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}neurotic, overly moussed hair sort of way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:16.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放荡不羁 喷了太多定型液的头发 自以为魅力四射
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:17.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:17.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你开心就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.71,0:10:20.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if you think I'm gonna stand back and watch while you favor her...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.71,0:10:20.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但若你以为在我面前偏袒她 我会袖手旁观…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:21.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't favor her. She's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:21.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有偏袒她 她很优秀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:23.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sure she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:23.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然是了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I point out that, technically, I'm your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我提醒一下 严格来说我是你上司
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:27.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:27.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不怕你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:31.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I'm not gonna advertise your extracurricular activities with my intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:31.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我不会到处宣传 你和我的实习医生私下乱搞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:35.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}However, the next time I see you favoring Meredith Grey in any way,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:35.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是下次再让我看见 你有任何偏心梅若迪丝葛蕾的行为
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:38.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll make sure she doesn't see the inside of an OR for a month...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:38.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就让她一个月都进不了手术室
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:40.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}just for the sake of balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:40.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是为了公平起见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.67,0:10:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We're all set, Doc. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.67,0:10:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 都准备好了 医生 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Annie, there's gonna be a microphone in there for you in case you get scared
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}安妮 里面有个麦克风 万一你感到害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:54.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or you want to get out, but try not to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:54.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是想出来就能使用 但请尽量克制
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.33,0:10:56.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because then we're gonna have to start all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.33,0:10:56.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然我们就得从头来过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:58.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm fine. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:58.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要紧 我不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:11:01.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you're gonna be fine, because I'm gonna be right over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:11:01.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你不会有事 因为我全程都会站在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:03.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}behind that glass, waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:03.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就在那片玻璃后面等着你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.17,0:11:06.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- All right? - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.17,0:11:06.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好吗？ - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.67,0:11:07.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.67,0:11:07.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:09.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Are you really ready? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:09.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.42,0:11:10.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.42,0:11:10.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:11.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等会儿见
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:21.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, man, you got an extra battery?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:21.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄 你有备用电池吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.12,0:11:24.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.12,0:11:24.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:28.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've never seen anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:28.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从没见过这么大的肿瘤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:33.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, what I don't understand is how a person lets it get like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:33.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 我不懂的是怎么会有人 任由肿瘤发展成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.58,0:11:37.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, man, that is a whole lot of nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.58,0:11:37.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 那还真够恶心的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.33,0:11:38.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe she's afraid of doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.33,0:11:38.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许她怕看医生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:40.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:40.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Poor thing? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可怜？拜托哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:43.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're afraid of doctors, you take a pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:43.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怕看医生的话 好歹也吃药啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's just sick, like, warped, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她就是心理有病那种
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.79,0:11:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously, I don't know how she lives with herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.79,0:11:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说真的 不知道她是如何自处的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:53.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:59.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At first, we thought she was just putting on weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:59.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}起初我们以为她只是变胖了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.67,0:12:03.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When we realized what was happening, I tried to get her to go to the doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.67,0:12:03.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}后来我们发现是怎么回事后 我就劝她去看医生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:05.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but she was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:05.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她太害怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:08.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And the bigger it got, the less she wanted to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:08.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肿瘤越大 她就越不想看医生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:12.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And she never really felt all that sick until last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:12.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她到昨晚才真的感到很不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:14.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She couldn't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:14.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她无法呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:17.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because the tumor was crushing her lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:17.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为肿瘤压迫了她的肺部
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:19.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, well, I called 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:19.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 所以我叫救护车了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.25,0:12:22.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It just seemed like the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.25,0:12:22.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得该那么做才对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:28.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The right thing to do would have been to call a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:28.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实一年前就该这么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.46,0:12:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.46,0:12:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, Mr. Levangie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}勒凡吉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.25,0:12:40.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We're gonna get you more comfortable, OK? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.25,0:12:40.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会让你舒服一点 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:42.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna go downstairs, and I'll be back up shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:42.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我先下楼一趟 很快就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:44.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- OK. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:49.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:49.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.25,0:12:52.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm sorry, Doctor... - Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.25,0:12:52.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 抱歉 这位医生… - 我姓葛蕾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My dad seems to like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爸似乎很喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's always liked skinny blondes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:56.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他一向喜欢身材苗条的金发妞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:58.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that rude? I'm sorry. I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:58.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样很没礼貌吧？抱歉 我太累了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there something...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.25,0:13:02.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was wondering if you would talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.25,0:13:02.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在想你能否和他谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.33,0:13:05.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- About? - Brain surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.33,0:13:05.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 谈什么？ - 脑部手术
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.67,0:13:08.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The doctor mentioned it, and I've read about it online.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.67,0:13:08.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}之前医生提过 我也上网查了相关资料
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:12.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it worked, it could help with most of his symptoms, not just pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:12.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若成功 除了缓解疼痛 也能减轻他大部分的症状
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.29,0:13:16.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Is he a candidate? - He is, but he's afraid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.29,0:13:16.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 评估过可以做手术吗？ - 可以 但他不敢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Surgery on his back, he can understand, but his brain...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}背部手术他能理解 但脑部…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:21.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and... there are risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:21.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且还伴随风险
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:24.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- But his quality of life... - There isn't any.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:24.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 但他的生活质量… - 毫无质量可言
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:26.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it keeps getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:26.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且还越来越糟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.92,0:13:30.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm getting married next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.92,0:13:30.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我下个月要结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:32.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I already lost my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:32.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经失去了我妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:34.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I want him to walk...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:34.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望他能陪我走…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:39.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want him with me. Maybe that's selfish, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:39.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望他陪着我 也许这样很自私 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:42.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you don't know what it's like having a parent...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:42.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不知道这种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.50,0:13:44.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}watching him...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.50,0:13:44.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看着他…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.71,0:13:46.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.71,0:13:46.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.50,0:13:49.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do know what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.50,0:13:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很明白那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:51.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:51.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会尽量想办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:53.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:53.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:54.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:54.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.67,0:13:56.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.67,0:13:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:03.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The right hemidiaphragm is so high
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:03.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}右侧膈位置太高了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:05.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that it's completely displacing her lung tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:05.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}导致肺部组织完全移位
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:08.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's infiltrated her spinal canal in three places.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:08.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}椎孔已经有三处遭渗入
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:10.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We should start there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:10.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们应该从那着手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's gonna take three or four hours just to get around those nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}光是绕开那些神经就要三、四小时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:15.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd prefer to start in front and then flip her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:15.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我较想从正面开始 然后再做背部手术
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:17.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You never know what kind of vessels are involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:17.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不确定会牵扯到哪条血管
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How intertwined they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有缠绕的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:20.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna need a good head start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:20.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一开始我希望求稳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should really go with the spine fresh, if I miss a step,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很需要从脊椎开始 以免稍有不慎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:24.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}she's paralyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:24.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她就瘫痪了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:25.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I don't relieve the pressure on her lungs,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我不先释放她肺部的压力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:28.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}she'll be dead, so she won't mind if she can't walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:28.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她就死定了 所以瘫痪是其次问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.67,0:14:30.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think she really wants to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.67,0:14:30.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们真觉得她想活下来？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.29,0:14:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on. She's been housebound.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.29,0:14:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托哦 她一直宅在家里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:37.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's been living under this thing, just watching it grow for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:37.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她和这个肿瘤生活这么久 就这样任由肿瘤变大 多久了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:41.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She doesn't seem stupid. Doesn't even seem all that scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:41.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她看上去并不蠢 也不是很害怕的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.67,0:14:44.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would anyone wait this long unless they wanted to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.67,0:14:44.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果不想死的话 谁会等这么久？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.29,0:14:46.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}People do things every day that they know could kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.29,0:14:46.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}人们每天都在做找死的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.46,0:14:48.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doesn't mean they want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.46,0:14:48.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但不代表他们真的想死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.79,0:14:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are her chances of surviving the surgery?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.79,0:14:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}手术成功的机率有多大？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.04,0:14:52.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Slightly better than if we do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.04,0:14:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比我们什么都不做好一点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:54.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So is it worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:54.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那值得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.92,0:14:58.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, come on. You were already thinking it. I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.92,0:14:58.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少来了 我只不过是说出 你们心里的想法罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.38,0:15:02.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's 43. It's worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.38,0:15:02.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她才43岁 值得一试
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:09.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:09.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫瑞堤医生请至4672号病房
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Shepherd...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薛波医生…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.25,0:15:19.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Levangie, the Parkinson's patient...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.25,0:15:19.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那位帕金森氏症患者勒凡吉先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.83,0:15:21.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}is he a good candidate for DBS?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.83,0:15:21.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他适合做脑深层刺激术吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:23.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but he's not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:23.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}适合 但他不想做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:27.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, but I think it's worth talking to him again, pushing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 但我认为值得再说服他看看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:28.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're talking about a brain surgery
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:28.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这可是脑部手术
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that is performed while the patient is wide awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且手术过程中患者是清醒的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.92,0:15:34.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There is a risk of paralysis, a risk of death, and the patient doesn't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.92,0:15:34.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接受手术有可能瘫痪 甚至死亡 患者并不想动手术
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.75,0:15:38.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is not my job to push him into anything and it's definitely not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.75,0:15:38.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不该说服他接受手术 你更加不应该那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.92,0:15:41.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Since you're uncomfortable with my decision in this case,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.92,0:15:41.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然你不满意我的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.83,0:15:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- it's probably best you don't scrub in. - But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.83,0:15:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 还是别参加我的手术好了 - 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:45.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a minor procedure. You won't be missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:45.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这只是个小手术 不来也不会怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:56.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, they call you the Nazi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:56.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别人都叫你纳粹
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:15:58.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:15:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我听说了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.33,0:16:05.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I won't lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.33,0:16:05.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会骗你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:07.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The surgery is going to be long and difficult,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:07.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}手术十分漫长 而且很不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.29,0:16:11.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but we have an extremely capable surgical team, and I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.29,0:16:11.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们有极为优秀的外科手术团队…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.12,0:16:12.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Am I gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.12,0:16:12.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会死吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's always that risk,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}手术总有风险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:18.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but if we don't do the surgery...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:18.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但若我们不做手术…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:20.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll definitely die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:20.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我必死无疑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:22.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:22.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:24.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很快吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.42,0:16:25.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.42,0:16:25.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:30.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Mom, the room's clean. - OK, honey, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:30.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 妈妈 病房很干净 - 好 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.62,0:16:31.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.62,0:16:31.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:33.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She'll have the surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:33.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她要做手术
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:34.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:34.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.71,0:16:36.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No, Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.71,0:16:36.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别说了 安妮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She will have the surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她要做手术
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:45.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess I'll have the surgery...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:45.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来我得做手术了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think that is a very wise decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是非常明智的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:50.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On one condition. I don't want him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:50.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我有个条件 他不能在场
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:54.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:54.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}安妮 不好意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.71,0:16:56.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did I upset you in some way?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.71,0:16:56.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我哪里得罪你了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:16:58.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If he's in the surgery, I'm not having it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:16:58.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他如果在场 我就不做手术
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:03.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's how I live with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:03.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我这人就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, Ms. Connors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 康纳斯女士
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:09.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Karev.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:09.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}卡瑞医生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.21,0:17:20.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.21,0:17:21.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你到底做了什么？ - 没有啊 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.29,0:17:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:24.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Man. The mike must have been on. I was talking to the tech guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:24.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 天啊 - 应该是麦克风没关 我和技师聊…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:26.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If anything goes wrong, anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:26.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}万一手术出任何差错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:29.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you are 60% more likely to be sued if you've offended the patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:29.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你被告的机率会多六成 因为你冒犯了患者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:31.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Sixty percent. - I never would have said that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:31.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 六成机率 - 我那是无心说的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:34.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The mike shouldn't have been on. I didn't realize she could hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:34.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}麦克风不该开着 我没想到她听得见
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:37.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, now you won't realize your chance to scrub in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:37.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你也没机会参加手术了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:40.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're banned from the OR. Mine or anyone else's. All week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:40.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}禁止你一周不准参与 我或任何人的手术
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:43.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got the history on the tumor. It's been growing for a year and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:43.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我查到肿瘤相关病史了 那颗肿瘤已经长了一年半
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:46.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A year and a half, and it's the first time she's even had it looked at.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:46.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一年半 她这才第一次来检查
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.67,0:17:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like she's fatally lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.67,0:17:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简直懒得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:54.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why doesn't she get banned?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:54.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她怎么没被禁止参加手术？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:58.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go prep Annie Connors for surgery. You're scrubbing in with Cristina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:58.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去帮安妮康纳斯准备做手术 你和克里斯廷娜要参与
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:17:59.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? I mean, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:17:59.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:02.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:02.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We just need to recheck your labs
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们需要重新化验一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:06.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and get an EKG, so I just need to take a little blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:06.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后做个心电图 所以我需要抽一点血
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:08.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Burke is great
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:08.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柏克医生医术精湛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and Dr. Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝利医生也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:11.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you're probably scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:11.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你可能很害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.62,0:18:12.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's OK, kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.62,0:18:12.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系 小子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can just do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你完成工作就好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:16.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't have to talk to the fat, nasty tumor lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:16.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不必和我这个 长了恶心肿瘤的胖女人聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.58,0:18:20.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I let it get this bad. How much sympathy do I deserve?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.58,0:18:20.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毕竟这是我自找的 我不配别人的同情吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:24.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why did you let it get this bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:24.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么让它长这么大？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:29.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're the first person since I got here to ask me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:29.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是我住院以来第一个这么问的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:32.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I guess it's just like the elephant in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:32.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可能是怕冒犯你才避而不谈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:33.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:36.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冒犯？ 你不觉得这根本像头大母猪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:34.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.29,0:18:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's more like a giant sow, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:46.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every time I went to the hospital, someone died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:46.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每次我去医院 都有人过世
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:49.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All four of my grandparents,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:49.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的祖父母、外公外婆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:50.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}then my dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:50.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后是我爸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.58,0:18:52.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}my best friend's mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.58,0:18:52.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我闺密的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.75,0:18:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}my baby sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.75,0:18:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的小妹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.67,0:18:58.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They all went in. Never came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.67,0:18:58.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们都进了医院 再也没出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.67,0:19:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I put it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.67,0:19:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我一拖再拖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.79,0:19:07.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, you're not the only one... to put things off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.79,0:19:07.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实你不是唯一会拖拖拉拉的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.46,0:19:09.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I never do anything till the last possible minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.46,0:19:09.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我每次都拖到最后一刻才肯行动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:11.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:11.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:12.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:12.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:18.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've had this thing for my roommate since, like, day one, and I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:18.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一开始就对我的室友有好感…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:21.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I... can't tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:21.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我…不敢告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:23.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She probably wouldn't go out with me, anyway, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:23.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然说了可能也没戏 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.38,0:19:26.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}how do I know that for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.38,0:19:26.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我连问都没问
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.62,0:19:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}if I... don't ever ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.62,0:19:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要怎么确定？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:35.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously? You're equating your pathetic love life with my record-breaking tumor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的假的？你居然把可悲的感情生活 和我破记录的肿瘤相提并论？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:38.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:38.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.71,0:19:44.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just that he blatantly favors me in front of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.71,0:19:44.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他先是在她面前公然偏袒我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.92,0:19:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and then blatantly dismisses me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.92,0:19:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}后来又当众给我难堪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you know he was favoring you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么知道他之前在偏袒你？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.83,0:19:52.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, you've got a brain. You got into this program.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.83,0:19:52.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 你是靠才智得到实习机会
