Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:12.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On a scale of one to ecstatic, ecstatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:12.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欣喜若狂 澎湃不已
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:14.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's unbelievable. You know what I think?
