Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.25,0:20:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think Burke wants to get into your scrubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.25,0:20:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得柏克看上你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.04,0:20:18.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are you sitting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.04,0:20:18.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干嘛坐在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:21.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He kicked me off that surgery for the same crap you pull every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我讲话毒了点他就不让我参加 但你每天都口出恶言
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:24.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? If I stuck this fork into his thigh, would I get in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:24.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我拿叉子插他大腿 我会有麻烦吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.71,0:20:26.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not if you make it look like an accident.
