Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? I think he's kind of great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？我觉得他很好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:42.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He reamed her out in front of Bailey.
