Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.71,0:20:58.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说我们所有人都可以去喝一杯…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.21,0:21:02.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you know, because of the bad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.21,0:21:02.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为今天不太顺遂…
