Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.71,0:21:29.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你的背部感觉如何？ - 很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.71,0:21:31.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good. How are you? Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.71,0:21:31.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好吗？还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.25,0:21:33.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you lean forward for me? I just want to check something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.25,0:21:33.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}身体能往前倾一点吗？我想检查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.04,0:21:35.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Does that feel OK? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.04,0:21:35.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这样感觉还好吗？这里呢？ - 还好
