Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你呼叫我了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:41.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Levangie, have you given any more thought
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:41.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}勒凡吉先生 我们今早谈到的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:44.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}about the other surgical options we discussed this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:44.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其他手术治疗方法 你是否有再考虑看看呢？
