Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.88,0:21:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:49.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would I? I already told you no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:49.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还考虑什么？我已经拒绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:53.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm letting you cut into my back,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:53.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我都让你们切开背部了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.79,0:21:55.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but that's not enough for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.79,0:21:55.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你却还不满足
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:21:57.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All you guys ever want to do is cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:21:57.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们医生满脑子想的都是动刀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.75,0:21:59.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dad, just listen to what he has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.75,0:21:59.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸爸 你先听听他怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:00.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I already listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.21,0:22:00.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经听过了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.62,0:22:04.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sir, there's a very small window of opportunity here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.62,0:22:04.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先生 做此手术的机会稍纵即逝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.17,0:22:07.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, once the Parkinson's progresses to a point of dementia,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.17,0:22:07.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一旦帕金森氏症发展成失智症
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.71,0:22:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you're no longer a candidate for DBS.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.71,0:22:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就不能接受脑深层刺激术了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.25,0:22:12.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And when I'm no longer a candidate,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.25,0:22:12.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等我无法接受手术时
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.25,0:22:17.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}is that when you people will leave me the hell alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.25,0:22:17.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们才不会再来烦我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.79,0:22:21.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Do I have to start drooling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.79,0:22:21.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是怎样？难道我得开始流口水
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.38,0:22:24.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and forget my name to get a little peace and quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.38,0:22:24.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}忘记自己的名字 耳根子才能稍微清净一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.42,0:22:26.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.42,0:22:26.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:28.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll check back with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:28.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我晚点再来看你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:29.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Try to get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:29.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好好休息
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.42,0:22:33.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dad, you're being unreasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.42,0:22:33.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸爸 你太不可理喻了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:35.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The doctors are only trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:35.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医生们只是想帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.71,0:22:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's my damn life, and it's my damn brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.71,0:22:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我自己该死的人生和脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want me to let them cut up my brain while I'm lying here awake. For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要让他们在我清醒的状态下 切开我的大脑 为了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Dad! - I'll be at your wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 爸爸！ - 我会出席你的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.42,0:22:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will sit in the back. Your uncle will walk you down the aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.42,0:22:49.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会坐在后排 你叔叔会挽着你进场
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.88,0:22:53.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know it's not perfect, but it's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.88,0:22:53.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道这不完美 但人生就是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:56.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Life is messy sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:56.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}人生有时就是一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:22:58.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:22:58.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.75,0:23:04.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If she knows...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.75,0:23:04.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果她真的知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.04,0:23:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}then what the hell are we still talking for, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.04,0:23:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们还有什么好谈的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.88,0:23:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why in hell can't she drop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.88,0:23:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她为什么不肯放弃那念头？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.88,0:23:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.88,0:23:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这确实是你的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.92,0:23:19.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it's her life, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.92,0:23:19.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但也是她的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:21.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you have a chance to get better here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:21.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你的病情有机会好转
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.46,0:23:24.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And all she's asking you to do is try.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.46,0:23:24.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她只是希望你能试一试
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.58,0:23:37.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If they pull this off, I'm totally calling Oprah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.58,0:23:37.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果手术成功 我一定要打给奥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.21,0:23:39.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You two been working out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.21,0:23:39.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们俩有没有健身？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.08,0:23:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sometimes I jog, and I try to take the stairs whenever possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.08,0:23:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有时候我会慢跑 一有机会我就走楼梯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.12,0:23:46.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.12,0:23:46.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么这么问？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.50,0:23:48.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See that large pile of tumor?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.50,0:23:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看见那个大肿瘤了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.54,0:23:51.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gonna be retracting it for the next 14 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.54,0:23:51.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接下来14小时 你们都要托住它
