Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.42,0:35:50.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}西雅图恩典医院真是欢乐无穷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.46,0:35:51.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.54,0:35:52.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.54,0:35:52.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.71,0:35:54.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get right in there. Get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.71,0:35:54.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快点止血 快
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.46,0:35:56.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She can't afford to lose this much blood. We need more blood here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.46,0:35:56.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的身体无法承受大量失血 我们需要更多血袋
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.75,0:35:58.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get me some suction here. I can't see what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.75,0:35:58.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快抽吸 我什么都看不清
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.88,0:36:00.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Clamp, clamp, clamp, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.88,0:36:00.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}血管钳 快
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.58,0:36:08.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Is there any blood in the rapid infuser? - We're waiting on two units.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.58,0:36:08.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 快速注射器里还有血吗？ - 有两袋正在送来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.67,0:36:09.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you mean you're waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.67,0:36:09.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.67,0:36:12.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We didn't anticipate this much blood loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.67,0:36:12.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没料到失血会这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.58,0:36:14.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We prepped a double supply. We've used it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.58,0:36:14.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们准备的双倍血量都用完了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.50,0:36:15.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What did you cut? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.50,0:36:15.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你切开什么了？ - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.46,0:36:16.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It just blew.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.46,0:36:16.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是它自己破的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.58,0:36:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She came in with too much damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.58,0:36:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她入院时就病情严重了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.00,0:36:21.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- The artery walls are too weak. - Take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.00,0:36:21.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 动脉壁太脆弱了 - 处理好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.54,0:36:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Annie, come on. - 10 units of O-negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.54,0:36:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 安妮 撑住 - …十袋阴性O型血
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.17,0:36:26.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I cannot see. What's this? George, give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.17,0:36:26.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看不清 这是什么？乔治 来帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.83,0:36:29.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Push right down here. Pull towards you. Suction, suction!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.83,0:36:29.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里帮我往下压 往你的方向拉 抽吸！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.75,0:36:30.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The pressure's dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.75,0:36:30.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}血压下降
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.75,0:36:32.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She needs blood. Where the hell is the blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.75,0:36:32.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她需要输血 该死的血袋在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.50,0:36:39.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Somebody grab that. Push it back, George. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.50,0:36:39.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁拿一下 用力推 乔治 加把劲
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.29,0:36:45.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God. Just squeeze it off right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.29,0:36:45.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 快压住那里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.62,0:36:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.62,0:36:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.83,0:36:54.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that O-negative for OR One?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.83,0:36:54.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给一号手术室的阴性O型血吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.50,0:36:56.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- OR One. Yeah. - OR One, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.50,0:36:56.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对 - 一号手术室没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.29,0:36:57.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got it! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.29,0:36:57.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}交给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.12,0:37:02.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some suction, please, in here, now. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.12,0:37:02.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}继续抽吸 就这里 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.29,0:37:06.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're losing her now. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.29,0:37:06.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她快不行了 看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.71,0:37:07.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.71,0:37:07.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坚持住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.38,0:37:24.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.38,0:37:24.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.83,0:37:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.83,0:37:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}撑住！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.54,0:37:58.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Time of death is 11:42.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.54,0:37:58.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}死亡时间11点42分
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.88,0:38:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.88,0:38:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我拿来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.08,0:38:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The early bird catches the worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.08,0:38:41.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早起的鸟儿有虫吃
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.42,0:38:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A stitch in time saves nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.42,0:38:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要防微杜渐
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.50,0:38:47.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.50,0:38:47.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}缝得真乱
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.04,0:38:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.04,0:38:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.33,0:38:50.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.33,0:38:50.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.50,0:38:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You saved his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.50,0:38:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你救了他一命
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.88,0:39:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He who hesitates is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.88,0:39:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}犹豫者必遭失败
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.21,0:39:18.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can't pretend we haven't been told.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.21,0:39:18.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不能装傻
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.62,0:39:21.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've all heard the proverbs,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.62,0:39:21.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都听过那些谚语
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.79,0:39:23.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}heard the philosophers,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.79,0:39:23.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听过哲学家的名言
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.83,0:39:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}heard our grandparents warning us about wasted time,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.83,0:39:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有祖父母告诫我们不要虚度光阴
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.38,0:39:31.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}heard the damn poets urging us to seize the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.38,0:39:31.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听过那些讨厌的诗词 督促我们把握时光
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.38,0:39:35.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Still, sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.38,0:39:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然而 有时候
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.25,0:39:37.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}we have to see for ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.25,0:39:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们就是得自己去领悟
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.75,0:39:53.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not doing you any more favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.75,0:39:53.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会再特别照顾你了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.08,0:39:55.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.08,0:39:55.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.92,0:39:59.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been holding 50 pounds of tumor for the past 12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.92,0:39:59.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我托着20几公斤的肿瘤12小时
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.67,0:40:02.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My back's gonna need traction, and the patient died anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.67,0:40:02.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我累得需要拉背 然后患者还是死了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.67,0:40:04.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you think you did me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.67,0:40:04.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还觉得这样是在照顾我？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.17,0:40:07.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.17,0:40:07.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.42,0:40:10.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.42,0:40:10.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.46,0:40:13.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that we're doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.46,0:40:13.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到底算什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.04,0:40:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.04,0:40:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.92,0:40:21.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You need a definition?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.92,0:40:21.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想要界定关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.83,0:40:23.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You really want to be that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.83,0:40:23.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真要被我绑住？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.50,0:40:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have to make our own mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.50,0:40:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们必须自己去犯错
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.71,0:40:33.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.71,0:40:33.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}锁门
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.92,0:40:39.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have to learn our own lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.92,0:40:39.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从中学到教训
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.62,0:40:40.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you seen Meredith?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.62,0:40:40.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你见到梅若迪丝了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.04,0:40:44.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Save yourself the misery, man. She's off the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.04,0:40:44.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你别自讨苦吃了 老兄 她名花有主了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.83,0:40:45.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.83,0:40:45.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.79,0:40:47.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that's not, we're just friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.79,0:40:47.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是那样 我们只是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.33,0:40:49.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.33,0:40:49.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随便你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.33,0:40:52.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But she's not. I mean, if she was seeing someone, I live with her, I would know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.33,0:40:52.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她还单身吧 不然我这室友会知道她有对象的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.83,0:41:05.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have to sweep today's possibility
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.83,0:41:05.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们总爱把今天的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.58,0:41:08.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}under tomorrow's rug until we can't anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.58,0:41:08.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拖过一天又一天 直到非面对不可
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.17,0:41:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}until we finally understand for ourselves what Benjamin Franklin meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.17,0:41:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}直到我们终于明白 班杰明富兰克林那句话的真正意涵…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.96,0:41:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that knowing is better than wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.96,0:41:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}清楚明白胜于疑惑不已…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.00,0:41:27.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that waking is better than sleeping...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.00,0:41:27.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}清醒胜于沉睡…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.33,0:41:35.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I, um, know this place
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.33,0:41:35.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道有个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.92,0:41:40.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}where there's an amazing view of sunrise over the ferryboats.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.92,0:41:40.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以坐渡轮看日出的迷人美景
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.33,0:41:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a thing for ferryboats.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.33,0:41:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢渡轮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.38,0:41:48.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.38,0:41:48.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我记得
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.71,0:42:02.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that even the biggest failure,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.71,0:42:02.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…还有即使遭遇重大失败
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.75,0:42:06.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}even the worst, most intractable mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.75,0:42:06.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就算是犯下最严重、无法挽回的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.75,0:42:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}beats the hell out of never trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.75,0:42:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也远远胜过从未尝试
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.46,0:42:50.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}字幕翻译：许晨翎
